       01 px-plugin-request.
          05 px-plug-raw pic x(32768).
          05 px-plug-length binary-long.
       01 px-plugin-result.
          05 px-plug-valid pic 9.
          05 px-plug-id pic x(128).
          05 px-plug-id-length binary-long.
